  \strong{\code{go_scattersmith_marker_line()}}: Reverses the color
  mapping if true. Has an effect only if in `marker.line.color` is set
  to a numerical array. If true, `marker.line.cmin` will correspond to
  the last color in the array and `marker.line.cmax` will correspond to
